  "solution": "**Given:**\n\np = 1 + √3\n\nq = 1 - √3\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n(p² + q²) = p² + q²\n\n(a ± b)² = a² ± 2ab + b²\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ p² = (1 + √3)²\n\n⇒ p² = 1² + 2 × 1 × √3 + (√3)²\n\n⇒ p² = 1 + 2√3 + 3\n\n⇒ p² = 4 + 2√3\n\n⇒ q² = (1 - √3)²\n\n⇒ q² = 1² - 2 × 1 × √3 + (√3)²\n\n⇒ q² = 1 - 2√3 + 3\n\n⇒ q² = 4 - 2√3\n\n⇒ p² + q² = (4 + 2√3) + (4 - 2√3)\n\n⇒ p² + q² = 4 + 4 + 2√3 - 2√3\n\n⇒ p² + q² = 8\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 8.**",
